Part of Assignment 2 of Machine Learning coursework at Carnegie Mellon University

Implement K-means algorithm and apply it to cluster genes using the mouse gene expression data from three brain
tissue types, HIP, PFC, and STR. For each tissue type, data are provided in two files, one for
expression data, where the rows are for mice/samples and the columns are for genes, and
the other file for gene names. Answer the following questions on the tissue type HIP.
